#. column 8: A compact, stylish pouch with a strap to be slung over the shoulder, designed with an egg motif perfect for the Hatching-tide season. Now shinier and eggier than ever!
msgctxt "Item:37394:0:9"
msgid "Authentic Archon Egg Pouch"
msgstr "Особая сумочка с яйцом архонта"

